{"3974210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZomBFF", "steam_appid": 3974210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>TWO MINDS ONE BODY</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f82b363cc7fb6a279be6a4230a79cf72.poster.avif?t=1788013611\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f82b363cc7fb6a279be6a4230a79cf72.webm?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f82b363cc7fb6a279be6a4230a79cf72.mp4?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After a disastrous resurrection ritual, the souls of two frogs become trapped inside a fallen king, splitting his brain into two halves. Each player controls one side of the royal disaster: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One controls the right side. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other controls the left.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i><strong>IT TAKES TWO TO TANGO</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/b43adf8f8bbfaa3f0a8383a799b88300.poster.avif?t=1788013611\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/b43adf8f8bbfaa3f0a8383a799b88300.webm?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/b43adf8f8bbfaa3f0a8383a799b88300.mp4?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Walking becomes a challenge of timing and teamwork. Alternate your steps and keep the rhythm to move forward — step at the same time and watch your king collapse into a glorious ragdoll mess. Stand up. Try again. Probably fall again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MANY HANDS MAKE LIGHT WORK. THESE HANDS MAKE CHAOS.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/b7482c150183c7c3309e574296d8997e.poster.avif?t=1788013611\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/b7482c150183c7c3309e574296d8997e.webm?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/b7482c150183c7c3309e574296d8997e.mp4?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Everything requires cooperation. You are not two characters working together. You are two players fighting over one body. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GET RID OF EVERYTHING THAT BOTHERS YOU</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/352f620456d590bf7fb1f55604d98a0b.poster.avif?t=1788013611\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/352f620456d590bf7fb1f55604d98a0b.webm?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/352f620456d590bf7fb1f55604d98a0b.mp4?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Kick obstacles to break paths or unleash unexpected chaos. But think twice before kicking innocent things, they might be your nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PHYSICS-DRIVEN MAYHEM</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/6d2ab948faa88bf310a0734eb30fac2a.poster.avif?t=1788013611\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/6d2ab948faa88bf310a0734eb30fac2a.webm?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/6d2ab948faa88bf310a0734eb30fac2a.mp4?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The zombie king is far from graceful — every step wobbles, arms swing uncontrollably, and one wrong move can turn into a full ragdoll disaster. Physics transforms simple actions into chaotic fun as you kick objects, shake trees for falling apples, and throw anything you can get your hands on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SURVIVE THE JOURNEY</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/e560915b6682366aee41551b6e3cebcd.poster.avif?t=1788013611\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/e560915b6682366aee41551b6e3cebcd.webm?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/e560915b6682366aee41551b6e3cebcd.mp4?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the throne by surviving deadly challenges. Fall into water or plunge from great heights? The witch’s magic returns you to checkpoints so you can fail forward together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>ONLINE OR LOCAL CO-OP</strong></i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/27bdd5f8836c91bdfdf82804e7b7ab44.avif?t=1788013611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras_big/27bdd5f8836c91bdfdf82804e7b7ab44.webp?t=1788013611 width=1560 height=504 /></span>Play together in local co-op or team up online — coordination is key whether you’re side by side or miles apart. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>TWO MINDS ONE BODY</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f82b363cc7fb6a279be6a4230a79cf72.poster.avif?t=1788013611\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f82b363cc7fb6a279be6a4230a79cf72.webm?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f82b363cc7fb6a279be6a4230a79cf72.mp4?t=1788013611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After a disastrous resurrection ritual, the souls of two frogs become trapped inside a fallen king, splitting his brain into two halves. Each player controls one side of the royal disaster: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One controls the right side. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other controls the left.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i><strong>IT TAKES TWO TO TANGO</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=